# Single-app source root.
#
# Use this layout INSTEAD OF apps/ + packages/ when:
#   - You have one deployable artifact
#   - You don't need to share types between processes
#   - You want minimum ceremony
#
# Suggested subfolders:
#
#   src/
#   ├── components/     — reusable UI (frontend)
#   ├── pages/          — route-scoped containers (frontend)
#   ├── routes/         — HTTP routes (backend)
#   ├── services/       — business logic
#   ├── repositories/   — data access
#   ├── schemas/        — Zod / Pydantic schemas
#   ├── state/          — state machines, enums
#   ├── lib/            — utilities, API client
#   ├── types/          — type definitions
#   └── config/         — env-driven config
#
# Delete this .gitkeep when the folder has real content.
# If you switch to monorepo later, move src/ contents into apps/<app>/src/.
